  Id: BuyTower
  Title: How to buy a tower
  Pages:
  - Left stick moves. Right stick turns. B jumps; press again in the air to double
    jump. A opens commander overview, X toggles the main panel, and Y toggles the
    map on your right controller. Right trigger selects. Right grip cancels construction.
